Hi <%= @user.name %>,

<%= @by || "Someone" %> turned off two-factor sign-in on your HardPoint account at <%= @account.name %>, because you'd lost your phone. You've been signed out everywhere.

Sign in again at <%= new_session_url(subdomain: @account.subdomain) %> with your password, then set up two-factor again under My profile with your new phone.

If you didn't ask for this, tell the shop's owner straight away and change your password with "Forgot password?" on the sign-in page.
